# OpenCL-ICD-Loader
### The Khronos libOpenCL.so: it dispatches to the drivers listed in /etc/OpenCL/vendors (rusticl.icd of
### lfs/Mesa). The ocl-icd alternative generates its sources with ruby on the build host
PKG_VER=2026.05.29
PKG_URL="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenCL-ICD-Loader/archive/refs/tags/v${PKG_VER}.tar.gz"
PKG_DEPS="lfs/OpenCL-Headers"
BUILD_PROCESS=cmakebuild
### A top level project includes CTest: its tests would be built by the all target
CONF_FLAGS="-DBUILD_TESTING=OFF"
PKG_MAKETARGETS="all,install/strip"
